/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4594:      "docstring": "Build nested square frames from a stack of horizontal color stripes.\n\nInput structure:\n- Full-width horizontal stripes of distinct non-bg colors, stacked vertically.\n- Each stripe has uniform color and variable height (1-4 rows).\n\nRule:\n- Read stripes bottom to top.\n- Bottom stripe becomes the center solid square with side length = stripe height.\n- Each subsequent stripe wraps the current shape with a square frame of thickness = stripe height, in that stripe's color.\n\nKey insight: Stripe height doubles as both frame thickness and (for the innermost) center-square side length; output dimensions are fully determined by the stripe heights.",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4606:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4661:        "output",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4697:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4727:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4853:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4897:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:5043:        "code:output_resize",
