/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:6665:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:6675:      "docstring": "Decode a stamp map: read templates, markers, and palette from a tiled grid, then render stamps.\n\nInput structure:\n- Grid divided into K tile columns (each N wide) separated by 1-col dashed separators.\n- Top band (rows 0..N-1): K template masks, one per tile column.\n- Middle band (rows N+1..2N): marker pixels whose color picks a template.\n- Bottom band (rows 2N+2..): K palette swatches giving the output color per template.\n- Separator rows at rows N and 2N+1 (dashed pattern of sep color).\n\nRule:\n- Each marker's local position (lr, lc) within its tile column determines which N×N output block to stamp.\n- The marker's color identifies which template to use; the palette recolors the template.\n\nKey insight: Marker color encodes template index; local position within tile column encodes stamp block.",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:6690:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:6751:        "output",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:6801:        "code:output_resize",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:6814:        "dst": "fill holes d (4-connected components of non-frame pixels) inside the largest frame sprite; output is cropped to the frame bbox",
